{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然距离休业式没剩几天，不过考试已经结束，等着寒假到来的学生们其实还挺有空闲时间的──", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“濑名同学～我向社团的大家收集了连署喔～”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "jc0046", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的？我记得你是啦啦队社的。”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3188", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“果然还是会想帮男生的棒球社和足球社的比赛加油嘛，欸嘿嘿……”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "jc0047", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "各務台男子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生～这叠纸本搬去印刷室就好了吗？”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": "db0026", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……对，麻烦你了！我把现在手上的份装订好之后也会过去！”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥，１年级帮忙的学生。”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": "sk0642", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟预想的一样，确定好升学目标的学生大家都挺有空的呢～”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "mu0305", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我回来了～哼哼哼嗯，看啊这么多的连署……不愧是我。”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 334, "voice": "sn0207", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "收集连署比预料中的更顺利。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我跟爱理忙到昏天暗地，但这也是快乐的负担。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“老实说，我以为会很难从没有体验过男女合班的人那边收集到连署……”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3189", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“或许昨天班上同学的那种忌妒，全校的学生都有同样想法？”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸、啊……”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3190", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我、我们、在别人面前有那么明显吗……？”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3191", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是不是不是，我不是指那个，而是T班男女生都有让她们很羡慕之类的。”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说……说的也是，我们没有那么高调对吧。”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3192", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真是的，不要吓我啦……我还以为是不是接吻被看到了……”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3193", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呐呐，听说濑名同学他们在校内接吻了喔～”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": "sb0041", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“！！？”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3194", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不、不要说出去！拜托不要再散播出去了～！”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3195", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君……你的女朋友真的傻傻的欸～”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "da0038", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊真的很抱歉，拜托饶了我们吧！”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“两个人的脸都好红～”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": "sb0042", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新……新吾这个笨蛋！”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3196", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸、我吗！？”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“都是新吾把话题带到奇怪的方向……”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3197", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“第二回合要开始了是吧喂！”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 334, "voice": "sn0208", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……不、不是的，大家、不是那样的！”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3198", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感谢招待！”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 305, "voice": "sb0043", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“！”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3199", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "话说回来，如果大家是因为羡慕的话，那我跟爱理也不能没有行动。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请慢走～请慢走～离开前～”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "ag0597", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请帮我们连署！”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3200", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这是给为了正式合并而努力的学园长的加油连署！”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟放学后站在校门口送大家离开的安洁一起，我们积极地收集连署。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“此时此刻兰华小姐不在校内，现在是绝佳机会喔，唔呼呼～”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "ag0598", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你，安洁。有引人注目的安洁帮我们一起喊，真的帮了很大的忙。”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3201", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼～不愧是安洁呢！”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "ag0599", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且新吾同学、爱理同学。像这样站在校门口，有没有发现什么事呢？”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "ag0600", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……什么事？”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所有学生们比起１０月刚开始的时候，都变帅、变可爱了呢～安洁是这么觉得的。”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "ag0601", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……啊……嗯，这样一说的确……”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3202", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为有我们各务台的男生在，结女的学生们都开始注重了起来。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "反过来说，因为同学们是大小姐──各务台的人也不会让自己松懈下来。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想起以前学园长在全校集会上说过的话。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……果然，女性就是要有男性、男性要有女性的视线才行吗？”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈哈，好像是那样呢～爱理同学♪真的变漂亮了～”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "ag0602", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什……别、别这样啦……”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3203", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该说，爱理从以前就很可爱。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哇～新吾同学的放闪力实在太惊人了！！”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "ag0603", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3204", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理同学都说不出话来了。”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "ag0604", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "始终很生涩的部分也很可爱啊，这句话就别说出来了吧。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之，收集连署进行得很顺利──", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“该怎么说呢……只有这样是不是不够……？”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "离开了校门口，我们来到学生食堂喝饮料休息。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "此时，我突然想到这个问题。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也有同样的感觉。”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3205", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理露出了烦恼的表情。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，身为学生要做到比这更多的事情……如果变成募款的话实在有点那个。”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3206", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是不是，我不是那个意思，是指对学园长来说。”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯？”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3207", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“连署的数量的确是一股支持的力量，但是该怎么说呢……”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我渐渐在脑中整理出思绪。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "连署的数量的确是一股力量，可是再怎么说都只是数字……", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你想想，学园长是个在全校集会的时候，总是看着全部学生的脸说话的人对吧？”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……啊！”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3208", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不必详细说明就理解，爱理的眼神闪闪发光。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，这个“不必详细说明就理解”的默契让我们都笑了。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对吧？”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……说的对，也想要做到那样呢。”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3210", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这也是从爱理提出的收集连署支持学园长的大方向联想到的。”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我们，好像是两个人在思考一样呢。”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3211", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不知不觉中就变成这样了。”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们又对彼此微笑。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "手伸向对方，指尖交缠。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我是我，新吾是新吾……”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3212", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“女生和男生。”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……但是。”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3213", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大小不同的手与手交握在一起。", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“‘我们’……对吧。”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3214", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的温度和爱理的温度传达给对方。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "成为分不出是谁的体温，但又同时是两人的体温。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯！走吧新吾。还有很多同学还在学校呢！”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar3215", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好！”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
